member.summary:
光源控制器工厂类
Exapmle P9F:
IHTPower _HTPower = HTPowerFactory.CreatePower("P9F");
HTCommunicationInfo _communicationInfo.socketInfo = new HTSocketInfo(){ IP = "192.168.1.35", Port = 8080};
_HTPower.Init(_communicationInfo);
_HTPower.GetConnect();

